sequenceDiagram
    participant D as docker push
    participant P as nginx
    participant C as Core
    participant R as Registry
    participant S as /data/registry

    D->>P: GET /v2/ (no token)
    P->>C: /v2/
    C-->>D: 401, realm /service/token
    D->>P: GET /service/token
    P->>C: /service/token
    C-->>D: token (checks the project's permissions)
    D->>P: PUT /v2/<project>/<repo>/... (token)
    P->>C: /v2/...
    C->>R: the same request, as the registry's basic auth user
    R->>S: writes blobs and the manifest
    R-->>D: 201
